ass=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts\">ImportedConsts</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Replaces the node for `n` using `f`. `n` must be a prefix shared by several modules, such as a\n`Duplicate` name; single-module subtrees are never modified. The result has no cache of its own.","docLink":"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts.modifyAt","kind":"def","line":625,"name":"Lean.ImportedConsts.modifyAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/ConstTrie.lean#L625-L631"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts.mergeModuleTreesLazy\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">ImportedConsts</span>.<span class=\"name\">mergeModuleTreesLazy</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">trees</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ConstTrie\">ConstTrie</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">resolve</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> := <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\">x</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem?\">[</a><span class=\"fn\">0</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem?\">]</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem?.getElem?\">?</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts\">ImportedConsts</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Merges per-module trees, given in module order, into a single tree, merging each node's entry and\nchildren on first access. Only name prefixes occurring in more than one module get fresh nodes;\nsingle-module subtrees are shared with the given trees. `resolve` picks the entry stored for a name\ndeclared by several modules from the candidate entries, given in module order. Conflicting\ndeclarations must have been ruled out beforehand, e.g. using `collectDuplicates`.","docLink":"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts.mergeModuleTreesLazy","kind":"def","line":558,"name":"Lean.ImportedConsts.mergeModuleTreesLazy","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/ConstTrie.lean#L558-L567"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/ConstTrie.html#Lean.ImportedConsts.collectDuplicates\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">ImportedConsts</span>.<span class=\"name\">collectDuplicates</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span clas